    "Raster graphic created by Sumo Paint, a free online Flash image editor that runs within a Web browser; supports colors, layers, filters, and other image effects; saved in a compressed format; can be exported to.PNG and.JPG formats in Sumo Paint. When saving an image, users can select to store a file on the Sumo Paint server or to the local hard drive. To store the file on the server, users must register an online Sumo Paint account. NOTE: Sumo Paint is accessed online through the Snap Groups Sumo Paint website. It runs as a Flash application within a Web browser that has the Flash Player plugin. Sumo Paint Pro, the commercial version of Sumo Paint, includes a local copy of Sumo Paint, which can be used offline. Windows Snap Group Sumo Paint. Mac Snap Group Sumo Paint. Linux Snap Group Sumo PaintFree.",
