    "Image file created by the GNU Image Manipulation Program (GIMP), a freely distributed image editing program; saves layers, channels, paths, guides, and the current selection when saved. XCF stands for eXperimental Computing Facility, which is a group of mainly undergraduate students interested in advancing Computer Science. Web File Helper. Photopea. Windows GIMP. CorelDRAW Graphics Suite 2023. CinePaint. XnViewMP. IrfanView. Mac GIMP. Seashore. CinePaint. XnViewMP. Linux GIMP. CinePaint. KolourpaintFree.",
