    "File used by Webshots Desktop Connect, a program that allows users to share, organize, and view pictures; contains a collection of.JPEG pictures stored in a proprietary format; used for organizing multiple pictures in a single collection; often contain encrypted data. NOTE: Webshots Desktop Connect was formerly known as Webshots Desktop and was owned by AG Interactive before being acquired by Threefold Photos in 2012. Windows Threefold Photos Webshots Desktop Connect. Ultimate Webshots Converter. fCoder Group Image Converter Plus. XnViewMP. Mac Ultimate Webshots Converter. XnViewMP. Linux Ultimate Webshots Converter. XnViewMPFree.",
