    "3.5",
    "File used by GIMP, an cross platform, open source image editor; contains gradients that can be used to fill images or shapes with varying degrees of colors, as specified by each gradient; loaded automatically by GIMP on startup and not meant to be opened manually by the user. Windows GIMP. Mac GIMP. Linux GIMPFree.",
