    "Game Maker Background Image File",
    "3.5",
    "Graphic file used by games created with GameMaker, a game development IDE published by YoYo Games; contains a collection of images that can be tiled in the background of a game scene; also stores the backgrounds name and target image size. GMBCK files are used by GameMaker for auto-generating in-game textures; they may be created and saved using the Background Properties window in GameMaker. Windows YoYo Games GameMaker: Studio.",
