    ".PICTCLIPPING",
    "Picture Clipping File",
    "3.4",
    "Image captured by the Mac OS X Finder when a user highlights and drags a graphic to the desktop; supports both image content as well as embedded textual data; often used for copying iTunes album cover art graphics. Picture clippings can be converted to other image formats using Lemkesofts GraphicsConverter application. NOTE: PICTCLIPPING files can also be created using other selected content, such as highlighted cells from an Apple Numbers spreadsheet. Mac Apple Finder Included with OS. Lemkesoft GraphicConverter.",
