    ".CE",
    "ComputerEyes Image",
    "3.4",
    "Bitmap image created by ComputerEyes, an image capturing program written for the DOS operating system; contains an image scanned by a Digital Vision scanner board; used for storing captured still frames from videos. While the ComputerEyes software is no longer supported, CE files can still be read by some third-party programs. Windows XnViewMP. Newera Graphics Converter Pro. Mac XnViewMPFree.",
