    "Desktop background that can be used as a wallpaper for the desktop screen; similar to a static desktop background, but may contain images from photo albums like a slideshow. DTW files are designed to be portable, meaning they can be shared with other computers and display the same dynamic content. Windows My Better Desktop Full Suite My Better Desktop. Viewer Mac My Better Desktop Full Suite My Better Desktop. Viewer.",
