    ".HPI",
    "Hemera Photo Objects Image File",
    "3.2",
    "Proprietary image format used by Hemera Technologies for stock photos and royalty-free images; contains a header similar to a.PNG image and stores color information much like a.JPG image. Hemera software programs include BizArt, Photo Clip Art, Photo-Objects, and The Big Box of Art. Hemera is now part of Thinkstock. Windows Hemera software HPI Converter. XnViewMP. Mac Hemera software XnViewMPFree.",
