    "WinSpec CCD Capture File",
    "3.0",
    "Plugin file used by SPSS, a data mining and statistical analysis application; may stores custom dialogs (.SPD files) or other data that extend the functionality of SPSS; often used for distributing custom extension bundles to users. If you receive an SPE file, you can install it by selecting the file from the Utilities → Extension Bundles → Install Extension Bundle.. dialog. You can create extension bundles using the Utilities → Extension Bundles → Create Extension Bundle.. dialog. Windows IBM SPSS. Mac IBM SPSS. Linux IBM SPSS. Contains image data captured on the CCD of a PIXIS camera or other Princeton Instruments device; can be analyzed and modified using Roper Scientifics WinSpec or WinView software. Windows Roper Scientific WinView or WinSpec.",
