    "3.0",
    "File used by [email protected], a program used for creating and putting together puzzles; contains an image broken up into puzzle pieces as well as background music; stored in a compressed format for Internet sharing. PZP files are the zipped form of.PZL files. Windows Tibo [email protected]. Project file created by PhotoSuite, a program used to edit digital photos; contains project images, settings, and resources; saves project as a layer-based compositions so that historical edits are modifiable; useful for creating templates for business cards, calendars, and greeting cards. MGI PhotoSuite was acquired by Roxio and was renamed to Roxio PhotoShow. PZP files created by PhotoSuite are not compatible with PhotoShow. However, PhotoSuite, which is now included with Roxio Creator, can open PZP files. Windows Roxio Creator NXT Pro 9. Roxio PhotoShow Mac Roxio PhotoShow.",
