    "Game Maker Sprite File",
    "3.0",
    "Graphics file created by Game Maker, a program used for developing cross-platform video games, supporting iOS, Android, Windows, Mac OS X, and HTML5 platforms; saves a collection of sprites that are used for displaying graphics in the game. GMSPR files are used as the storage format when working with sprites in a Game Maker project (.GM81 file). Windows YoYo Games Game Maker.",
