    "3.0",
    "Animated image sequence used by Atari ST systems, which were discontinued in 1993; includes multiple bitmap animation frames, as well as the duration and speed for the sequence; used for creating animated images with various resolutions. TNY files are also stored in low-res (.TN1 files), medium-res (.TN2 files), and high-res (.TN3 files) formats. Windows XnViewMP. Newera Graphics Converter Pro. Mac XnViewMP. Linux XnViewMPFree.",
