    "DEGAS Image",
    "1.0",
    "Bitmap image created by DEGAS, an early image-editing application for the Atari ST systems; supports color images; can still be opened with the XnView image viewing program and converted to more common image types. The Atari ST was a computer system that was popular in the late 1980s and early 1990s. It was discontinued in 1993. Windows XnViewMP. Mac XnViewMP. Linux XnViewMPFree.",
